# DKIM signing keys live here, one set per mail domain:
#   una.<domain>.key      private key, mounted read-only into rspamd
#   una.<domain>.pub      public half
#   una.<domain>.dns.txt  the TXT record to publish
#
# install.sh writes the first set; Settings -> Domains writes one per domain
# added afterwards. Both rspamd (read-only) and web (read-write) mount this
# directory -- see docker-compose.yml.
#
# IMPORTANT: never commit private keys (.key files) to git.
